    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sĭlărus</span></b> , i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σίλαρις</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a river forming the
				boundary between Lucania and Campania</i>, now <i>Sele</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, § 70</span></i> (al.
			Silerus) sq.; 2, 103, 106, § 226; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				146</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8, 582</span></i>.—Also called
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Silerus</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4,
			9</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Siler</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Luc. 2,
			426</span></i>; Col. poët. 10, 136.</div>
